{"title":"Math League Press","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Math League Press is a regional subdivison of the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Math_League\" title=\"Math League\">Math League</a>.\n</p><p>The following states are constituencies of the Math League Press: Alaska, Arizona, Arkansas, Delaware, Hawaii, Iowa, Kansas, Kentucky, Montana, Nebraska, Nevada, New Mexico, North Carolina, North Dakota, Oregon, South Carolina, Tennessee, Utah, West Virginia.\n</p><p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Math_League_Press&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n\\\n</p><p>I LOVE MATH\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017194220\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.005 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.009 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 7/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 292/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.387      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    5.387      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:7385:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017194220 and revision id 230023. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}